# Portability patches (format and list: docs/UPSTREAM_CHANGES.md).
patch: lwc-decrypt-free-on-tag-mismatch
why: crypto_aead_decrypt allocates `state` and `tag` with malloc and frees them on success, but returns on a tag
why: mismatch without freeing them: every rejected ciphertext leaked the keyed sponge state (LeakSanitizer, CI run
why: 45581879065). The patch frees both before that return; the return value and every other path are unchanged.
file: upstream/ref/encrypt.c
count: 1
find:                                 return(KAT_CRYPTO_FAILURE);
replace:                                 { free(state); free(tag); return(KAT_CRYPTO_FAILURE); }
